Is the respondent a male or a female?</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>Male</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Female</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr></w:tbl><w:p /><w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b /><w:b-cs /><w:sz w:val="24" /><w:sz-cs w:val="24" /></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve">CONSENT </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p /><w:tbl><w:tblPr><w:tblStyle w:val="TableGrid" /><w:tblW w:w="0" w:type="auto" /><w:tblLook w:val="01E0" /></w:tblPr><w:tblGrid><w:gridCol w:w="1548" /><w:gridCol w:w="3600" /><w:gridCol w:w="3374" /></w:tblGrid><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /><w:shd w:val="clear" w:color="auto" w:fill="000000" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:pPr><w:bidi w:val="off" /><w:rPr><w:color w:val="FFFFFF" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r><w:rPr><w:color w:val="FFFFFF" /></w:rPr><w:t>Question ID</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /><w:shd w:val="clear" w:color="auto" w:fill="000000" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:pPr><w:bidi w:val="off" /><w:rPr><w:color w:val="FFFFFF" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r><w:rPr><w:color w:val="FFFFFF" /></w:rPr><w:t>Question</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /><w:shd w:val="clear" w:color="auto" w:fill="000000" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:pPr><w:bidi w:val="off" /><w:rPr><w:color w:val="FFFFFF" /></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r><w:rPr><w:color w:val="FFFFFF" /></w:rPr><w:t>Answer</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>519</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">Hello, my name is {0}. I am here on behalf of researchers at Princeton University conducting a research project to learn about the experiences of people living in the South South. We are not from the government.  We would like to learn some basic things about you, your community, and what you think about some important things in Nigeria today.</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t /></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>520</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">Participation in the study involves completion of an oral interview, which will last for approximately forty minutes. I will ask you a series of questions, and will record the answers on a phone. If you agree to participate, your answers and your participation will be completely anonymous. Identifying information will NOT be recorded, and your name will not be available to anyone.</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t /></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>521</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">If at any point you feel uncomfortable answering a question, you may refuse to answer.  You may also refuse to participate in the research at any point, you may ask me to not use information that you have already told me, and you may ask me to stop writing down your responses at any time.</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t /></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>522</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">The results of the research may be published in a professional publication or presented at professional meetings. The information will help policymakers in Nigeria and in other countries in West Africa to better understand the needs of communities like yours.</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t /></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>523</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">If you have any questions, please feel free to contact my supervisor, the investigators, or the Institutional Review Board at Princeton University. The contact information for all parties is provided in this sheet you can keep.</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3374" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t /></w:r></w:p></w:tc></w:tr><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="1548" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>524</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:w="3600" w:type="dxa" /></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">INSTRUCTION TO ENUMERATOR:

